{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t財政司司長陳茂波說，在充滿不確定性的環境中，保險業需要增強自身的強韌性。<br/>\n<br/>\n國家金融監督管理總局副局長叢林表示，近年內地的保險業的高質量發展取得明顯進展，國家願與各地推進區域保險交流合作。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:00:54.674542+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:40:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T15:17:02.433684+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:54:26.492147+00:00","content_hash":"20069a1f8cdbbc27f9f2d1e6a634f1fb56121e47f930232e6a6ebc030f5635ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}